  "guidelines": "Version 14 notes revised under the Study Studio natural-experiments guidance, with a strict 300-word maximum per page. Experiments are explained in connected sentences without report-style labels, and experiment pages gain source-based explanation toward the 250-300 word range. Repeated restatements and closing summaries that add no new fact are removed and long sentences are split for reading aloud, while every source term, value, study and figure detail stays. Study Studio teaching notes per source page, in source order. Bolded main bullets of connected read-aloud sentences with nested sub-bullets for mechanisms, experiment setup, observations and interpretation, and the values in instructional figures. Direct explanations without added caveats, presentation narration, arrow chains, colons or semicolons, or outside material. Title, divider and link-only pages remain visible without invented explanations. Earlier editions are not rewritten.",
